#: scenario4:scenario4_DC2A8067_BE03_4F93_BCA8_AA4BB14E7DB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e51ea37b393c1b8259ebc049408b4322925aac3427a0db20192bb79d25075ae
