msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There once was a witch, skilled in the dark arts. ⟪k:3⟫She lived a meager, but "
"peaceful life alongside the other villagers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il était une fois une sorcière versée dans les arts obscurs. ⟪k:3⟫Elle menait une "
"vie modeste mais paisible en compagnie des autres villageois."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15ED5119_5FCA_49D1_BCE5_D6457583B0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fac8ce667094c5335f5139ce404baba7c360d391247d211d669c1a748c7fb0b6
#. default-sha256: c42ec21bf846cae36506f3b1196d2522f863ba6286f14ec567c590e6d215fbd4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15ED5119_5FCA_49D1_BCE5_D6457583B0F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But then, a long, long drought struck the village, which the people blamed on the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est alors qu’une très grande sécheresse frappa le village, et les gens tinrent la sorcière "
"pour responsable."

#: scenario4:scenario4_822F34E0_7F5A_4C54_85DC_AFC9FE8F3246
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66db56aa3eabb3c8ac561284d02985c17d374d09bd6dca02f5d7609d23b4f994
#. default-sha256: 6dff71a9de7f40614fae54fde869e395df6ba79de50e2c17a3bfaf6409105657
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_822F34E0_7F5A_4C54_85DC_AFC9FE8F3246"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The witch was sentenced to death, and as the fire blazed around her, smoke rose high into "
"the air. ⟪k:1⟫The smoke soon became rainclouds, blessing the village with an end to the drought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sorcière fut condamnée à mort et, tandis que le feu crépitait autour d’elle, de la fumée "
"s’éleva haut dans le ciel. ⟪k:1⟫La fumée se transforma rapidement en nuages et la pluie vint "
"bénir le village en mettant fin à la sécheresse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_75ECEF99_AB6A_493F_AFDD_4BF1231C32D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff94a7169cc7ff8edb8e745bb5cdc226e7c26bf9c979bc4bca6da453c753d905
#. default-sha256: 667d2cd28ddf323bdc1678d4bdb8531491f4cd7f104d7be078b223a6ce4c632f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75ECEF99_AB6A_493F_AFDD_4BF1231C32D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The crops were revitalized, and the villagers fancied themselves heroes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les cultures reprirent et les villageois se prirent pour des héros."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1FEBF35B_74A9_426A_9ED0_662304A26013
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8395f1d0098e14afcf19c76562b9620f37b6cb70f7161f26cd7a1c8df450fd16
#. default-sha256: 1503e22b3d3aaacd48f26b1ea7ace174605dbb16a4bd5f43127da30d8fd147c8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1FEBF35B_74A9_426A_9ED0_662304A26013"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the rain also brought madness upon the people.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though the earth below them "
"was lush and fertile,⟪k:3⟫the villagers were losing their minds,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cependant, la pluie apporta également la folie au village.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La terre sous leurs "
"pieds était luxuriante et fertile⟪k:3⟫mais les villageois perdaient la tête"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C231E26C_8323_44D6_A318_3DB948571F9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 154ed0598a77518dcec42e7d5681357251f8c9905445ae6c9508a22c7e6bdabd
#. default-sha256: a24074ef3679eaf8b693e88acd149c6096284e6b22ef775f3f9b1a90964cddef
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C231E26C_8323_44D6_A318_3DB948571F9E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and they eventually began to take each other’s lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et ils finirent par s’entretuer."

#: scenario4:scenario4_98DF4AD6_699B_490B_98F3_DFC68EF93678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb85554e098b9225a2289b3995cfc2a9263b388c88c2a4461e2427ee563df97e
#. default-sha256: 647d436ca585a54940834369ae25a5839954f6b037fbaeaecd1e8a79cddc5bfa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_98DF4AD6_699B_490B_98F3_DFC68EF93678"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The witch still lived on—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in the form of a curse."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La sorcière survécut—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ sous la forme d’une malédiction."

#: scenario4:scenario4_680BBEDF_F173_4408_A332_5B7F1413A312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc943fe66c8a45bc3d5d89c10ae63d119a1f71576ac36112685b493d71c073e4
#. default-sha256: c02721ebfa373cfbc0f4e7cb6eb4568d848ae23d43c84789b773a8805d50ec00
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_680BBEDF_F173_4408_A332_5B7F1413A312"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many fell victim to the witch’s curse. ⟪k:1⟫Though it did not only take—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫it also "
"fulfilled people’s desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nombreuses furent les victimes de la malédiction de la sorcière. ⟪k:1⟫Mais ce sort ne "
"faisait pas que détruire—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ il exauçait aussi les souhaits des gens."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E93AF0E_3F0B_43E5_8203_FF7AFE8D2AB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42416e28649ce1ae8d17949cfefd162024516b4438109209f1f50afaba8062a2
#. default-sha256: 70dd84c0ec18ba45a1f92cd4d5481ea38bc3404f6cc14c7d1c6922449b7f13a7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E93AF0E_3F0B_43E5_8203_FF7AFE8D2AB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The villagers had gone mad, but their wish for freedom from the drought ⟪k:1⟫had⟪k:2⟫ been "
"granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les villageois étaient devenus fous mais leur vœu d’être libéré de la sécheresse avait ⟪k:1⟫"
"bien⟪k:2⟫ été accordé."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DA9543CD_FB3A_4F1B_9495_C239A9AF7A23
