msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_270F6A86_8C3F_43D8_84F0_27CEBECB8C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫After much climbing, they finally arrived at the top, where a door made of "
"partially rotted wood stood. ⟪k:3⟫Michel pulled open the door,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫À⟪k:4⟫ force de grimper, ils finirent par arriver au sommet, où une porte en "
"bois partiellement rouillée les attendait. ⟪k:5⟫Michel poussa la porte,"

#: scenario4:scenario4_49F2455F_56FD_480D_9FBD_536B2CAB6D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94ce09daa2e5559492f66346f51f852b5da6718b7c1cac544f3fe448325da91d
