msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is... ⟪k:3⟫the top of the tower?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est... ⟪k:3⟫le haut de la tour ?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 028d4b59b10a1dd401021542c345911ed88c5840368dbb7323dbc653eda535da
#. default-sha256: 7bd77f38d05031621e778b30ce1762e59bc183feb8f7a15c14743916fd96a8d3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being called an “observation” tower,⟪k:1⟫you could hardly observe anything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle avait beau être appelée tour « d’observation »,⟪k:1⟫on ne pouvait pas distinguer grand-"
"chose depuis cette pièce."

#: scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e93474bb17c43b5fefd0ae9f896d4c730836293cb45c03bef6fc8189fcbe43b
#. default-sha256: 845150e581008ac42da81b0b061014a3bd17f8b0f1a51b56425f592b7733d177
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her face contorted in confusion, the White-Haired Girl threw her gaze about the room. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Glancing up, she saw only a darkened ceiling—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, perplexe, embrassa la pièce du regard. ⟪k:1⟫En levant les yeux, "
"elle ne vit qu’un plafond noirci—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c93e9b129da7c4abe50cc6981fb4c8ac7f7537f7795ff15ec75a407f2c34eb32
#. default-sha256: 9de2f76f909843ff9b9551a3b33f65cadbdce21a466e775f4c72c23864d17234
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EE08DDC7_DBCC_4473_8EE1_206FC8B7867A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and, slightly below it, a single small window through which shone a little ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫et, juste un peu en-dessous, une toute petite fenêtre qui laissait passer un mince rai de "
"lumière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b172a7450ab088d323f8c0cff71a47d336f69e5e8f0d9203fb0282284068177
#. default-sha256: 4868f85952c6779805c90b22be5772980be17c672c02d5662659d2a425cb8de6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC304EF2_BDBB_4265_B4C3_F2B09A7FAB33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beam cleaved through the darkness like the sharpened blade of a beautiful sword."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le rayon de soleil perçait l’obscurité comme la lame aiguisée d’une belle épée."

#: scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6db71cbf499dec4756dcebea937f674bd3f962338b770850ab9b35ec693fb84f
#. default-sha256: 7a06a4523eb788c29c874dd9191061fdf496f5b610096ce9ba939b26a8b74708
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_87F10E3A_D125_40FE_B5DE_6D19AF1ACCB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness draped over the rest of the room only served to make more impressive that "
"solitary ray of light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’obscurité enveloppait le reste de la pièce de sorte qu’elle ne faisait que renforcer, par "
"contraste, l’éclat de cet unique puits de lumière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25d9488d7ad4a4a6e65392c6e495367e9c4be879e56d0ebc09004aaffe16471f
#. default-sha256: b8226862ef41bc5298d3e53e18b894328fef5bf255ff89f73404d64275b83a8f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D72BA3A5_89B0_4D14_AC35_7B775885F7FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had a magical, fairy-tale quality to it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cela rajoutait un côté magique, digne d’un conte de fées."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d24dee10479e4bb3a95f9715bfee391b6f93c45f3cec1651c877d915f70d71
#. default-sha256: 8721e874913d8b85f8f8bb757c84daa4f3cd5eaf80ce7e7291e1f7b33a647220
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1E541513_5969_453E_8B6E_BABD41A78AAF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As if being pulled in by it, she drew toward the light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comme attirée, elle se dirigea vers la lumière."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 619da19c8e279037704052e07a3a874a9f8a50c0e4a6fa20564961a208e453ab
#. default-sha256: bd0051237c4f4794ef5783e79a36c9cc3e3aac2637f6507acc3caa604089dacb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54096ADB_53CA_44CA_990D_3DC843B79FC4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suspect there was once a large window in this room.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you look closely, you can "
"see seams in the stone of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pense qu’il y avait autrefois une large fenêtre dans cette pièce.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Si vous "
"regardez attentivement, vous en verrez les contours dans le mur de pierre."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa28ac5f0f7fb5fa48dd4c1078cfa056c4cc6c5361c9e5b80ab08e5dbe0200d4
#. default-sha256: bfd07cd466a7cbef949e44b3045cb8c652f3e329259dc2122e2b5a7a26e674d2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B7DE50E3_2E21_43BD_9075_6A1080080B63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The color of the stone differs slightly on either side of the seams.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I presume "
"something caused them to seal off the window⟪k:3⟫after it was built."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La couleur de la pierre diffère sensiblement de chaque côté de ces traces.⟪k:1⟫ Je suppose "
"que quelque chose a dû les pousser à condamner la fenêtre après la construction."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0312598547f47ffc5cd9491d69a456ae48dcda4f7aad7b733995bce4ea4d9a01
#. default-sha256: c3bd1b95d047b61cc22b115f14e2371322bb30d9fb412379c61e8aa862d0535e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A1A2EF23_130D_4C4C_BC72_7BB2EB6D00E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though I don’t know what that something... ⟪k:1⟫might... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais je ne sais pas ce que ce quelque chose... ⟪k:1⟫peut bien... ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫être..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 214b7332f1ba8f746e3821c01817ef88a1d2a3e7d13f8dc19f53119ad1a5dd6f
#. default-sha256: 66efccbeb7fbd55d6ec3859d76e67e7945907fbbc77ebc43c5355d5fc1846729
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7F25F21C_F8FC_41CB_B6C9_005B238CE407"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫When Michel’s eyes fell upon the White-Haired Girl "
"wrapped in that beam of light, he sputtered to a stop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Quand le regard de Michel tomba sur la Fille aux "
"Cheveux Blancs drapée de lumière, ses paroles tournèrent court."

#: scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 658f497e49975256b68656634d862724640c9271bf681b08cbeec2f884d40e7e
#. default-sha256: d17fc113813fff8be27185744fd92b4fc31c277725dbebfc07d2639fe293edf7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_61BB9077_43C2_47AA_A83A_8106A68E8A21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man who never flinched at anything—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who had long since distanced himself from "
"such stirrings of the heart—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was utterly bewitched."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’homme que rien ne faisait vaciller —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ qui s’était depuis longtemps coupé de tels "
"élancements du cœur —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ était totalement ensorcelé."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bdc59bc741d97e8de3ed97d0e6071d56bb3a41b7da338ea10b4830bf4bb3aad
#. default-sha256: 308d559a1a9862b085e83be72419169836097cc9897c824f347215066ff06148
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CDBA04FC_C536_4BA2_97AA_F8750736FF45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never seen her illuminated so vividly before, and he was having a great deal of "
"trouble finding the words to describe her striking beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne l’avait jamais vue sous une lumière aussi vive, et il avait le plus grand mal à "
"trouver les mots pour décrire son éclatante beauté."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a60fd12734de661a8b00611bc8d8d458ff3264bea148e3cbef399398ab6a9c9
#. default-sha256: 1f5bc75e02e17c5c1e8b6346ff802db784f4027a1054a92b12526549dd4c14a0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E2960547_51B6_4B7A_AB8B_50CDB511CE7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For someone who had been chased out of her home and accused of being a witch, the White-"
"Haired Girl looked less like a practitioner of the dark arts,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pour quelqu’un qui avait été chassé de sa maison et accusé de sorcellerie, la Fille aux "
"Cheveux Blancs ressemblait moins à une pratiquante des arts obscurs"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EE28FDA0_6292_4AA1_B783_8C17C869EBEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f9130208fd6560b807c9db9e4faae69a8fa6c476e57a6c06ddec7befc01313a
