#: scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0b3720e9b903a9f586a5937c0b6ded95105db3e0b172195049ae68dfa4a1067
#. default-sha256: da8b1655287ac8819bf4933ddf845b3bcd4fc8ee7727df40470c7f5f7a9aef8b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CF9D9494_DEED_4AA2_B5D7_D2144049DC87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel undoubtedly felt the same way, for his gaze was affixed firmly upon her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Michel pensait exactement la même chose que moi car son regard était fixé sur elle."

